+    $$ segment\_id = idx_x \cdot (G_y G_z) + idx_y \cdot G_z + idx_z $$
+    [S5, unofficial].
+    Apply `segment_func` (e.g., `tf.math.unsorted_segment_mean`) to aggregate point features into the dense grid [S5, unofficial].
 
